00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:06.625
Wh-What junior-high student
signs on with a sponsor?!

00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:12.208
No blind spots. We'll blow that
E Class away--as we should.

00:01:26.458 --> 00:01:29.125
<i>You're all I think about</i>

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:31.958
<i>Starting not to see anything else</i>

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:37.375
<i>I'll win your heart for sure--I swear</i>

00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:40.042
<i>Me, not cool? Oh, that old tale</i>

00:01:40.042 --> 00:01:42.750
<i>I've spared no effort since then</i>

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:46.542
<i>Should be over my problems by now</i>

00:01:46.542 --> 00:01:50.542
<i>I'm brimming with confidence: I can do it</i>

00:01:50.542 --> 00:01:53.542
<i>And just when I get warmed up</i>

00:01:53.542 --> 00:01:58.750
<i>Yeah, I get knocked down like this every time</i>

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:04.333
<i>Your scathing, serious voice cuts me</i>

00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:09.750
<i>Thousands, tens of thousands</i>
<i>of times I've given form to my feelings</i>

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:15.250
<i>Driven them in,</i>
<i>thrown them in--but all you do is run</i>

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:17.875
<i>Question, question: what</i>

00:02:17.875 --> 00:02:20.542
<i>Question, question: on earth</i>

00:02:20.542 --> 00:02:23.333
<i>Question, question: did I</i>

00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:25.917
<i>Ever know about you anyway?</i>

00:02:25.917 --> 00:02:28.625
<i>Question, question: why</i>

00:02:28.625 --> 00:02:31.333
<i>Question, question: is it</i>

00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:34.208
<i>Question, question: you are</i>

00:02:34.208 --> 00:02:39.167
<i>So close and yet so far away?</i>

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:47.000
"Tenth Period: School Festival Time"
"by Takuya Muramatsu"

00:02:47.417 --> 00:02:51.708
The main campus sure is
getting hyped about this year's festival.

00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:55.333
"Maid Café" "Crêperie" "Train-Station Bento Display"
Probably figure we're up to something, even if we can't win.

00:02:55.333 --> 00:02:58.458
I hear that Asano actually
contracted with a restaurant.

00:02:58.458 --> 00:03:01.083
I wouldn't put it past him.

00:03:01.083 --> 00:03:03.333
We'll just have to go for the win.

00:03:03.333 --> 00:03:05.750
This match will likely hinge on a compilation

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.917
of everything <i>but </i>assassination and studying.

00:03:07.917 --> 00:03:11.208
I really don't want to lose to the A Class...

00:03:11.208 --> 00:03:13.458
But what can we do?

00:03:14.875 --> 00:03:19.042
Asano's right. You need to tap into
that sense of getting a bargain.

00:03:19.042 --> 00:03:21.625
If you can use a tight budget
to make something of greater value,

00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:22.833
the customers will come.

00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:25.083
Well, yeah, but...

00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:28.292
The answers are all around you!

00:03:28.292 --> 00:03:31.375
The value of the E Class here

00:03:31.375 --> 00:03:33.083
lies in this,

00:03:33.083 --> 00:03:34.083
this,

00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:34.875
this,

00:03:34.875 --> 00:03:36.083
and this!

00:03:36.083 --> 00:03:38.375
These ingredients are like you:

00:03:38.375 --> 00:03:42.333
hidden in the mountains
where no one notices their efforts!

00:03:42.333 --> 00:03:45.000
So we attack our customers
with hidden weapons.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.792
Makes for a pretty assassin-y restaurant!

00:03:47.792 --> 00:03:53.083
Now to sell these blades
like you're going in for the kill!

00:03:55.875 --> 00:03:56.208
"Acorn Noodles" "3-E, Junior High"

00:03:56.208 --> 00:04:01.083
"Acorn Noodles" "3-E, Junior High"
Come on by! Acorn noodles made with real acorns!

00:04:01.083 --> 00:04:04.917
A new taste sensation made with
the mountain's natural goodness!

00:04:04.917 --> 00:04:08.083
Even upperclassmen like you--
adults who recognize value--

00:04:08.083 --> 00:04:10.375
will never have tasted deliciousness like this!

00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:13.375
Oh, yeah? Is it really that good?

00:04:13.375 --> 00:04:17.292
Of course! Taste the just-picked freshness!

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:31.000
"Acorn Café"

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.208
Huh. Nice place ya got here.

00:04:34.208 --> 00:04:35.167
Hey!

00:04:35.167 --> 00:04:37.750
It's the high-school guys from our class trip!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.417
What are <i>you </i>doing here?!

00:04:39.417 --> 00:04:43.167
Oh? Come to abduct another girl, have you?

00:04:43.167 --> 00:04:45.125
Like hell I am.

00:04:45.125 --> 00:04:48.750
Wouldn't want your freak of
a teacher to show up again.

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:53.083
But I don't need to
get physical to wreck your day.

00:04:53.083 --> 00:04:57.667
I could... start shoutin' that
your food tastes like crap, say?

00:04:57.667 --> 00:05:01.500
Or put a few choice words online?

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.708
Well? Bring it out already.

00:05:04.708 --> 00:05:07.500
Our signature dish: acorn noodles.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:12.083
Whoa, this looks great! Hey, Ryuki,
can I order a Mont Blanc, too?

00:05:12.083 --> 00:05:14.542
Yeah! I wanna try the smoked fish!

00:05:14.542 --> 00:05:17.500
Hey, cool it! Your stupid is showin'!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:20.750
Pfft. Leave it to a junior-high kid
to come up with this.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.583
One bite and I'm gonna puke.

00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:29.083
<i>S-So good</i>!

00:05:29.083 --> 00:05:32.542
We wanted to get <i>lots</i>
of reaction shots out of them...

00:05:32.542 --> 00:05:35.792
...but those cooking anime
have a monopoly on <i>that</i>.

00:05:35.792 --> 00:05:37.042
Uh, Fuwa?

00:05:37.042 --> 00:05:41.458
Not bad, right? I spent
a solid week on research.

00:05:41.458 --> 00:05:44.625
The noodles are acorn,
thickened with grated yam.

00:05:44.625 --> 00:05:47.833
Mountain foods are really strongly flavored,

00:05:47.833 --> 00:05:50.250
so I went with a rich dipping broth.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.000
It was hard work!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.250
These pork-bone/soy-sauce acorn noodles

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:57.083
are the result of my search
for the ultimate balance.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.083
True... I ain't ever tasted anything like it.

00:06:01.083 --> 00:06:01.375
"Smoked Freshwater Fish"
True... I ain't ever tasted anything like it.

00:06:01.375 --> 00:06:03.792
"Smoked Freshwater Fish"
