00:06:03.792 --> 00:06:05.583
"Smoked Freshwater Fish"
So much for your mediocre flavor being a selling point.

00:06:05.583 --> 00:06:08.083
"Smoked Freshwater Fish"
Shut up, Itona! Get to work!

