Never had that before!

00:06:13.167 --> 00:06:15.792
Hey, you jokers! Say it tastes like crap!

00:06:15.792 --> 00:06:17.833
Oh? It does?

00:06:17.833 --> 00:06:22.083
Oh, dear... Did you not
like my students' cooking?

00:06:22.083 --> 00:06:23.000
What a babe!

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.208
No, no, no, no, no--it's crazy good!

00:06:25.208 --> 00:06:25.583
"Persimmon-Loquat Gelatin" "¥150"
No, no, no, no, no--it's crazy good!

00:06:25.583 --> 00:06:30.292
"Persimmon-Loquat Gelatin" "¥150"
Oh? Then how about this persimmon-loquat gelatin?

00:06:30.292 --> 00:06:32.917
"Persimmon-Loquat Gelatin" "¥150"
It's exactly as soft as my skin.

00:06:32.917 --> 00:06:34.042
"Persimmon-Loquat Gelatin" "¥150"
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:34.042 --> 00:06:36.667
And if you eat one of everything,

00:06:36.667 --> 00:06:38.417
it would make me sooo happy.

00:06:38.417 --> 00:06:40.458
B-But I don't have the cash--

00:06:40.458 --> 00:06:42.875
There's one right by the train station...

00:06:42.875 --> 00:06:45.500
...an A... T... M.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:46.625
Time to make a withdrawal!

00:06:46.625 --> 00:06:48.750
Okay! I'll be waiting!

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:51.042
That's one tribute course down.

00:06:51.042 --> 00:06:53.500
With Yada at the bottom
drawing in customers

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.417
