00:07:43.375 --> 00:07:46.208
"Event Stage" "Entrance Fee" "Food & Drinks"
the next event starts right away on the other side.

00:07:46.542 --> 00:07:49.375
People will keep coming back,
paying the entrance fee each time,

00:07:49.375 --> 00:07:51.583
and by the time
they've satisfied their curiosity,

00:07:51.583 --> 00:07:54.417
their stomachs will be full to bursting.

00:07:54.417 --> 00:07:59.292
I doubt they'll feel like
going to the E Class's café.

00:07:59.292 --> 00:08:05.333
Okay, we're up. You get ready
while I knock out a few songs.

00:08:16.417 --> 00:08:18.917
Is there <i>anything </i>he can't do?

00:08:18.917 --> 00:08:19.917
Right?

00:08:19.917 --> 00:08:22.292
Honestly, he can do so much,
it's kind of disgusting.

00:08:22.292 --> 00:08:25.250
But even a guy like that can fail.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:28.167
Can't have that--not against
the E Class or anyone else.

00:08:28.167 --> 00:08:33.792
No matter how crafty our leader is,
I'm sick of seeing him lose.

00:08:33.792 --> 00:08:36.542
We're the chosen ones, too, you know.

00:08:36.542 --> 00:08:40.583
Learning an instrument
between study sessions is no big deal.

00:08:40.583 --> 00:08:42.583
Shall we give him some backup?

00:08:42.583 --> 00:08:43.708
Yeah!

00:08:43.708 --> 00:08:44.750
--I'll have this.
--Hey, Nagisa! You here?

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:47.000
--You got it.
--Hey, Nagisa! You here?

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.792
Here I am!

00:08:48.792 --> 00:08:52.667
Sakura! And Mr. Matsukata
and the rest of the kids!

00:08:52.667 --> 00:08:55.667
Hey, so you kept in touch, Nagisa?

00:08:55.667 --> 00:08:58.208
Yeah, I help her study sometimes.

00:08:58.208 --> 00:09:01.542
When your private
in-house tutor asks you to come,

00:09:01.542 --> 00:09:03.500
