--Way to go, Nagisa. We'll make bank on volume alone!

00:09:05.958 --> 00:09:07.375
--Ladykiller!
--Way to go, Nagisa. We'll make bank on volume alone!

00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:10.375
--How are you, Princess?
--Sorry we don't have deeper pockets.

00:09:12.708 --> 00:09:14.958
Oh, now, this is superb!

00:09:14.958 --> 00:09:17.417
Something this tasty is gonna sell for sure.

00:09:17.417 --> 00:09:19.750
It's been a struggle.

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:23.917
We can make good stuff,
but it's hard to let folks know about it.

00:09:23.917 --> 00:09:25.667
Hmm.

00:09:25.667 --> 00:09:28.000
Aw, but I wouldn't worry.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.708
You guys have this
mysterious power, y'know?

00:09:30.708 --> 00:09:36.708
Right. If your daily conduct is correct,
I'm sure word will get out.

00:09:37.833 --> 00:09:38.125
Thanks again!

00:09:38.125 --> 00:09:39.750
"Acorns"
Thanks again!

00:09:41.458 --> 00:09:44.875
I <i>am </i>confident about what we've accomplished so far.

00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:45.208
"Welcome to Kunugigaoka Junior High 3-E's Acorn Noodles"
I <i>am </i>confident about what we've accomplished so far.

00:09:45.208 --> 00:09:50.042
"Welcome to Kunugigaoka Junior High 3-E's Acorn Noodles"
But it'd be great if even one person could really spread the word.

00:09:50.042 --> 00:09:54.500
Listen, Nagisa, I heard
why you let your hair grow long.

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:58.000
I'm sorry. You didn't <i>want </i>to do it...

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.708
