00:10:00.708 --> 00:10:05.625
Oh, no, no! I can handle a little
ribbing from you and Karma.

00:10:05.625 --> 00:10:09.333
Oh, okay. I'll try to
lay off the teasing, anyway.

00:10:09.333 --> 00:10:10.917
Hey!

00:10:10.917 --> 00:10:13.958
That flighty voice...

00:10:13.958 --> 00:10:17.583
Nagisa! I came to hang out!

00:10:17.583 --> 00:10:19.250
Y-Yuji?!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:20.500
Yuji?

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:22.542
Oh, from the southern island--

00:10:22.542 --> 00:10:25.958
that guy who mistakenly fell for Nagisa!

00:10:25.958 --> 00:10:28.750
H-How did you know I went here?

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:31.667
I looked up the island's guest records.

00:10:31.667 --> 00:10:35.708
When I checked the school's website,
I saw your festival was underway!

00:10:35.708 --> 00:10:37.542
O-Oh, okay!

00:10:37.542 --> 00:10:41.375
Ah! Hey! Whoa! Nakamura!

00:10:42.875 --> 00:10:45.042
One last time! One last time!

00:10:45.042 --> 00:10:47.167
The words were barely out of your mouth!

00:10:47.167 --> 00:10:49.333
He's rich, isn't he?

00:10:49.333 --> 00:10:54.167
We've got to raise our
per-customer average any way we can.

00:10:54.167 --> 00:10:56.292
Go get 'em, Nagisa!

00:10:56.292 --> 00:10:59.000
The fate of the class
rests on your hostess skills!

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.000
Whoa!

